---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';

const lastUpdated = '21 September 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Hard Routine"
  description="How Hard Routine collects, uses, stores and discloses personal information, and how to access, correct or delete yours."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', item: `${site.url}/` },
    { name: 'Privacy' },
  ]} />

  <article class="wrap section prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="small text-lichen">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      Hard Routine ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This policy
      explains what personal information we collect through
      {site.url.replace('https://', '')}, why we collect it, who we
      disclose it to, and how you can access, correct or delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you register your interest, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your email address</li>
      <li>Your name, if you choose to give it</li>
      <li>Which product categories you're interested in, if you tell us</li>
      <li>Your IP address and the time of submission</li>
      <li>The page you submitted the form from</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      When you browse the site, our analytics provider collects aggregate,
      cookieless usage data — pages viewed, referring site, device type and
      country. It does not identify you individually and does not use
      tracking cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
    <p>We use this information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Notify you when Hard Routine launches</li>
      <li>Send occasional product news and updates, where you've consented</li>
      <li>Understand how the site is used, so we can improve it</li>
      <li>Meet our own record-keeping obligations under the Spam Act 2003, including proving that you consented to receive email from us</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      We collect and use your email address on the basis of the express
      consent you give by ticking the consent checkbox on our
      register-interest form. That checkbox is never pre-ticked, and the
      wording you agreed to is recorded and versioned against your
      submission.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we disclose it to</h2>
    <p>Your information is disclosed to the following service providers, who process it on our behalf:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Netlify</strong> — our website host and the handler for register-interest form submissions</li>
      <li><strong>Brevo</strong> — our email platform, used to send launch notifications and product news</li>
      <li><strong>Plausible Analytics</strong> — our website analytics provider</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal information, and we do not disclose it
      to anyone else except where required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Where it's stored</h2>
    <p>
      Netlify stores form submissions and site infrastructure in the United
      States. Plausible Analytics stores aggregate usage data in the
      European Union. Brevo stores email subscriber data in the European
      Union. By registering your interest, you consent to this overseas
      storage.
    </p>

    <h2>Accessing, correcting or deleting your information</h2>
    <p>
      To see what we hold about you, correct it, or have it deleted, email
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We'll respond
      within 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2>Unsubscribing</h2>
    <p>
      Every email we send carries a one-click unsubscribe link. Requests
      are honoured within 5 working days, and you can also unsubscribe by
      emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Complaints</h2>
    <p>
      If you think we've mishandled your personal information, email
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we'll
      investigate and respond. If you're not satisfied with our response,
      you can complain to the Office of the Australian Information
      Commissioner (OAIC) at
      <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au" rel="noopener">oaic.gov.au</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p class="not-prose">
      <strong>Hard Routine</strong><br />
      ABN {site.abn}<br />
      {site.postalAddress}<br />
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-prose { max-width: none; margin-top: var(--space-2); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
